From: DS4.1 runtime integration
Subject: [PATCH] DSpark: opt-in per-batch verify width with one gamma-3 draft

Keep scheduler reservation at width four and pair each verify backend/graph
with its own planner, epilogue and commit injector. The launcher gives the
initial target width-four capture only B1/B2; the worker captures width two
on B1/B2/B4 and the gamma-three draft on B1/B2/B4. Static verify only.

